  "listing": {
    "title": "Wedding Planner Spreadsheet Excel, Wedding Budget Tracker, Guest List RSVP Template, Vendor Contacts & Checklist, Google Sheets, Printable PDF",
    "description": "Plan your whole wedding from one workbook. The Excel spreadsheet (Google Sheets compatible) includes a wedding budget with estimated vs actual costs, deposits and automatic balance due, a vendor contact list with contract status, a guest list with RSVP, meal choice and table numbers, a month-by-month timeline checklist, and a dashboard with your total budget, amount paid, balance due and confirmed guests. The printable PDF planner adds a planning checklist, budget and vendor sheets, a guest list, a wedding-day timeline and vow notes for when you want to plan on paper.",
